<section class="tab {{tab.cssClass}}" data-group="primary" data-tab="settings">
  <h3>{{t "Sheet appearance"}}</h3>
  <div class="skin-box">
    <p>{{t "Ladder rung"}}: <b>{{skin.rung}}</b> — {{skin.why}}. {{t "Look from the ladder"}}: <b>{{skin.auto}}</b>.</p>
    <label class="skin-row"><span>{{t "Look"}}</span>
      <select name="flags.foe-rpg.skin.choice" {{#if skin.locked}}disabled{{/if}}>
        <option value="">{{t "automatic (from the ladder)"}}</option>
        {{#each skin.options}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}
      </select></label>
    {{#if skin.locked}}<p class="hint">{{t "The GM has set this sheet's look."}}</p>{{/if}}
    {{#if skin.canAccent}}
    <label class="skin-row"><span>{{t "Accent: magic colour"}}</span>
      <span><input type="checkbox" name="flags.foe-rpg.skin.accent" {{#if skin.accent}}checked{{/if}}> <small>{{t "dark looks take the screen colour from the magic colour"}}</small></span></label>
    {{/if}}
    <label class="skin-row"><span>{{t "State effects"}}</span>
      <span><input type="checkbox" data-foe-sheetfx {{#if skin.effects}}checked{{/if}}> <small>{{t "static, radiation, NO SIGNAL, KIA… — only on your screen"}}</small></span></label>
    {{#if isGM}}
    <label class="skin-row"><span>{{t "GM: force a look"}}</span>
      <select name="flags.foe-rpg.skin.forced">
        <option value="">{{t "no — the ladder decides"}}</option>
        {{#each skin.all}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}
      </select></label>
    <p><a class="button" data-foe-skin-editor><i class="fa-solid fa-palette"></i> {{t "GM: custom looks (editor)"}}</a></p>
    {{/if}}
    <p class="hint">{{t "The ladder, from the top: power armor worn (helmet HUD) → a PipBuck worn (Inventory → PipBuck, the “wear” switch; the model sets the shade) → another device with a screen worn (PRA, EqueMapper, portable terminal) → organization (Steel Rangers, raiders, EVC — from the creator's Organization trait) or origin (Enclave, zebra, griffin, ghoul, changeling) → the paper Stable character sheet. You can pick any look your character qualifies for; a PipBuck look only with a PipBuck worn."}}</p>
  </div>
</section>
